<title>CHINA: China wheat imports down by 74.8 pct in Jan-May.</title>
<headline>China wheat imports down by 74.8 pct in Jan-May.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 810,000 tonnes of wheat in the first five months of the year, down by 74.8 percent compared with the same period of 1996, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-MAY	MAY	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Wheat   810,000	     250,000	-74.8</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
